Oh, by the way, Yuusaku...

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:45.060
There's no way you can run fast with those bowlegs of yours!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:52.580
Oww Oww Oww...

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:53.910
Hey! Hold still!
Oww Oww Oww...

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.280
But...
Hey! Hold still!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:55.370
But...

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.230
Man, that's cold! What the heck is it?!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.660
It's a cold patch! If you aren't careful, you won't be able to compete.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:02.990
Well, there you go!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.960
O... oww...
Well, there you go!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.040
Well, there you go!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:08.740
You sure are dedicated!
Have you become a diehard sports maniac?

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.320
Why don't you get some exercise yourselves?!

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:14.180
I got these, y'know!

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.200
Here.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.370
It's easy if you wear a pair of these.

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:25.740
No!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.300
No!
No!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:27.390
No!

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.210
I can't use them?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.810
Of course not!
I can't use them?

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:30.900
I can't use them?

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.190
Well, worst case, I can use the Power...

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.170
...and run 3 km in 2 or 3 seconds!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.900
Are you nuts?!
We'd have to change schools again!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.960
That's right, Kurumi!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.630
Hey! You kids had better not be using the Power at school!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.140
But of course, daddy-o...

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:53.370
Kurumi!
But of course, daddy-o...

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.530
Huh?
Kurumi!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:01.210
At any rate... I've got to use
the Power this time, or else...

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:13.230
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:16.260
Sempai, wanna take a break for a while?

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.400
No, not yet!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.030
That's my man!
No, not yet!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:27.120
No, not yet!

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:31.090
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.900
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.370
That stubborn fool!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:43.350
There are a lot of people around there, so near the supermarket is out.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:48.600
Looks like I've got to teleport from that bathroom.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:50.340
And, then...

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:52.900
Kasuga... er...

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.370
Lemmesee... is that phone booth the only place I could...?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.800
I know I was acting really stubborn before, but... I'm...

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.860
What I mean is...

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.880
Oh, thanks for the cola.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.590
Say, Hikaru...

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:13.620
Wh...What the?! Ayukawa?!

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:16.910
Excuse me for being Ayukawa!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.100
A... Ayukawa...

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.390
W... Wait a sec! What brings you here?

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.690
How dare you!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.230
What's his problem?! Really!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:35.190
Wait! What's with this?!

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:37.390
Taking a cold shower, Sempai?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.440
Look, you!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:47.940
The fact is... things have gotten
very screwy between Ayukawa and me.

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:53.500
And THAT is something that I can't use the Power to fix.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.010
But I've got to get myself
out of this horrendous situation!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:59.620
Oooh, I wanna get myself out of this...

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:07.620
Ushiko, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.670
Umao, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.540
'Scuse me!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:21.520
Aoki.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:22.090
Here.
Aoki.

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:22.650
Okamoto.
Here.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:22.790
Okamoto.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:23.460
Here.
Okamoto.

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:24.050
Ozaki.
Here.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:24.190
Ozaki.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:24.650
Here.
Ozaki.

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.020
Kasuga.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.930
Is Kasuga absent today?

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.390
Sir!
Is Kasuga absent today?

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:31.480
Is Kasuga absent today?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.120
Apparently Kasuga's caught a cold,
so he'll be absent.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.360
I wonder if he's all right.
I mean, the marathon is tomorrow!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:41.400
Hey... maybe he deliberately
caught a cold by turning up the A.C.!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.740
I wonder... if it's because of what I did...?

00:17:55.820 --> 00:18:00.020
Poor Sempai... He was training so hard too.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:07.320
It was so wonderful to see him run so well.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.620
Do you know why he
became so serious about it?

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.200
Huh...?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.140
It's because...
Huh...?

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:15.430
...of what?
It's because...

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.520
...of what?

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:19.460
...he's doing it for the sake of somebody!

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:21.480
Oh, gosh!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.590
I'll go visit him after school!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:36.580
"Look... If we both get the first place prizes,
then everyone's gonna be..."

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.790
For somebody's sake...

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:53.200
At any rate... it was such an embarrassing way of catching a cold.

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:58.610
My Power is half gone now...
I'm gonna come in last for sure!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.930
Damn it, this sucks!
Maybe I should just bag it totally.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:06.960
I bet Ayukawa would mock me...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.740
Who is it?!

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:14.320
Be quiet, will ya?! I'll unlock the door!

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:28.680
Is that Kurumi? Or Manami?

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.530
What the heck do you want?!

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.550
A... Ayukawa!

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.820
Can I come in?

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:42.620
No! No! Absolutely not!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.620
Wh... Who would?! Who would let you in?!

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:19.080
Looks like I'm okay now...

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.130
Oh. I'm glad.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.880
I'm really glad...

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.520
I'm sorry for being obstinate about...

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:31.570
Don't be...

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.130
What's wrong?

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:50.560
Huh?
What's wrong?

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.390
Oh! Er...

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:56.800
Kasuga...

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.960
Huh?
Kasuga...

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:58.050
Kasuga...

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:01.100
If you're alone...
tomorrow isn't a sure thing, is it?

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.710
You mean...

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:17.160
You know, looks like my cold is gone!

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.820
Let's "goal in" together, okay?!

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:28.790
The truth is... I was hoping that you'd ask me that way in the beginning.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:48.130
All went well at the Koryo School Marathon...

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:53.210
...until the late afternoon,
except for some disqualifications.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:55.730
I guess we're busted, huh?

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:56.490
Yeah...
I guess we're busted, huh?

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:04.610
As expected, our class was running
so slowly we were the last of the worst.

00:22:04.610 --> 00:22:07.210
By the time it was our turn to run...

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:11.230
...the sun had already headed west.

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:31.030
Er...

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:47.000
What's taking them so long?

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:51.310
Hikaru... let's go home!

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.850
As if in a three-legged race... it somehow felt like...

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:16.360
...it felt like I could go on forever... together with Ayukawa.

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:40.590
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:44.850
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.850 --> 00:23:49.180
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:53.420
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.420 --> 00:24:01.300
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:10.800
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:18.610
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:27.290
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.290 --> 00:24:37.000
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:45.370
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:49.710
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.710 --> 00:24:54.050
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:58.350
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.350 --> 00:25:02.690
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.690 --> 00:25:07.510
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.360 --> 00:25:15.430
This kid... is my cousin, Kazuya.

00:25:15.430 --> 00:25:19.930
I can't say it out loud, but... you see... he's telepathic!

00:25:20.260 --> 00:25:23.080
He does things like hugging Ayukawa, or flipping her skirt up...

00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:26.410
He does one thing after another... the things I think about!

00:25:26.410 --> 00:25:30.240
Next time: "Introducing Kazuya!
Be Very Careful around the 'Panic Kid.' "
